  "body": "```\r\nFrom 2cb0189f535becad2a72d69f2998c09f8753a825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\r\nFrom: tii-admin <admin@tii.tu-dresden.de>\r\nDate: Thu, 14 Feb 2019 14:39:01 +0100\r\nSubject: [PATCH] Add env variable to enable URL previews in the generated\r\n homeserver.yaml\r\n\r\n---\r\n docker/conf/homeserver.yaml | 5 +++++\r\n 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/docker/conf/homeserver.yaml b/docker/conf/homeserver.yaml\r\nindex babd5bef9..f1ac226c9 100644\r\n--- a/docker/conf/homeserver.yaml\r\n+++ b/docker/conf/homeserver.yaml\r\n@@ -112,7 +112,12 @@ thumbnail_sizes:\r\n   height: 600\r\n   method: scale\r\n\r\n+{% if SYNAPSE_URL_PREVIEW_ENABLED %}\r\n+url_preview_enabled: True\r\n+{% else %}\r\n url_preview_enabled: False\r\n+{% endif %}\r\n+\r\n max_spider_size: \"10M\"\r\n\r\n ## Captcha ##\r\n-- \r\n2.11.0\r\n```",
